    {
      "id": "3949330a-544d-469e-8e17-6c81cc555fb6",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe o uso de el antes do dia.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 10,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "44dc2fcd-59a0-4e5d-97bc-ab1494278213",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando algo acontece em um dia específico, é muito comum ver <strong>el</strong> antes do nome do dia.</p><p><strong>el lunes</strong>, <strong>el jueves</strong>, <strong>el domingo</strong></p><p>Assim, o dia passa a funcionar como ponto claro do calendário.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ab3b7afe-1bcf-4cd0-8b4d-c79ecae54daa",
      "title": "Escute o áudio e observe a expressão completa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 11,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "48c42b33-90fe-4a14-bad7-e81be0460262",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora veja uma expressão que resume a parte mais regular da semana.</p><p><strong>de lunes a viernes</strong></p><p>Tradução: de segunda a sexta.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8e6ed4d1ea6a4efeb66ae672333b330c_b10-de-lunes-a-viernes.mp3?Expires=1794099502&Signature=yyxbC8L8kPQ8R67impsFg-66ZDz1zSikUPF9kfkLla8awkhRsptdDZAgxhpOseI3fP42tKgOdP13yqCDOTJjMNGacRc2Ddy8dT7SSM1uk2U1H5BeEZbHhsOarQ2n2l6v6M5YPD9EQP8gAhnTEgXHTrRPZDz9~doLs80IADWYyEPNYURsklpl6Vcy1zRtkuDyyNVcpu31H5K9UxLBAAGI8sSEiLz0coQlK0kDUMwSEGn3YY8DcC4LOhPDg08mgf3DntTlJHBhDPU74ut-dCQ6Y9Y9hPo0H3T-rnfEhxhf9MoneaxcoTVHKd8Pxwn77NaLlAXX-qa6lQQ3YIOkYCimhg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9eace190-955d-450d-a621-28832d3c9a71",
      "title": "Escute o áudio e associe a expressão a sábado e domingo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 12,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a197a120-3c92-4146-8bdd-f32176a57d62",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora veja a expressão que junta sábado e domingo.</p><p><strong>el fin de semana</strong></p><p>Tradução: o fim de semana.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/396126cca98f4644b9a541548a1030a1_b11-fin-de-semana.mp3?Expires=1794099502&Signature=IKBuOQzcnLjNOdLVwoDWhEIh~I5OSAIqR87itA8paBBrHIbcrzXLtetkj-3b3aZO1yUx2TPP2rQ54IrAvFK~TsxMf8w-wIKqdWo7ee07JjKm7Lg9txhdirnlCalTzsT8X0okbi~hdoBH4FZHYPrFMXhTeiPBUOVBX0-PFnAXkCGSoiIl72O19zAKxOegg2wT5yjf8V-HU-0H6vsvUOIS9l74P5qz4xvVSRwVBfQhsB68ZtMwU6bVNMOrHAQJNR9lOj6758hz9M1a0HFkJEzTuQhJB1GktVku7OOpCW~Utf9ObncT7JQ6L3Q2pvgVOScrCK~qkXDAfk5LrSD6WIi~Ow__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
